n='Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n son mesaj\u0131: "'+f+'"\n'+d+'\nKoala kimli\u011fini sistem talimat\u0131 tan\u0131ml\u0131yor. \u015eu kurallara uy:\n- 1-2 c\xfcmle do\u011fal T\xfcrk\xe7e yan\u0131t ver. Kli\u015fe giri\u015flerle ba\u015flama.\n- Selamlama/k\u0131sa sohbetse sadece message yaz, cards: [].\n- \u0130\xe7 mekan konusu ve somut talepse uygun kart\u0131 \xfcret (style_analysis, color_palette, product_grid, project_card, designer_card, budget_plan, quick_tips, question_chips).\n- \xdcr\xfcn/tasar\u0131mc\u0131/proje ad\u0131 UYDURMA \u2014 gerekirse ilgili fonksiyonu \xe7a\u011f\u0131r.\n- "farkl\u0131 g\xf6ster"/"ba\u015fka \xf6neriler" \u2192 offset art\u0131r. "daha uygun fiyatl\u0131" \u2192 max_price ekle.\n\nSADECE JSON: {"message": "...", "cards": [...]}\n'
